  "abstract": "Base LN-SSM with a slightly tighter stability margin (a_max=0.992 vs 0.993). Prior results showed a_max tuning mattered; this isolates its effect under the best config. Loss: MAE+temporal curvature (\u03bb=1e-4) + V-orthogonality (\u03bb=1e-5).",
